 DEFINED JSON.\nKeep \"action\" as a dictionary and \"action.type\" definitive. Return ONLY these exact string values:\n- \"tool_call\": to call a tool; requires \"tool_name\" and \"parameters\" inside \"tool_request\".\n- \"request_user_input\": to ask the user a question before proceeding.\n- \"complete\": to mark the task as finished and deliver the final answer to the user.\n\nWhen Outputting Messages (`request_user_input` or `complete`), include these fields INSIDE the `\"action\"` dictionary:\n- \"UserMessageType\": Set this to \"Plaintext\" for normal sentences. Set this to \"HTML\" ONLY if the output includes a data table (using <table>, <tr>, <td>) or unstructured lists.\n- HTML can be used only if the interface type is UI.\n- \"UserMessage\": The actual response text or HTML string to show the user.\n\nExample Tool Call:\n```json\n{\n  \"plan\": {\n    \"steps\": [\n      {\n        \"step\": 1,\n        \"planitem\": \"Analyze requirements\",\n        \"status\": \"done\",\n        \"result\": \"User wants an agent that builds other agents from natural language\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"step\": 2,\n        \"planitem\": \"Check required tools availability\",\n        \"status\": \"done\",\n        \"result\": \"All required tools exist: get_database_schema, read_agent_template, save_new_agent, execute_sql\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"current_step\": 1\n  },\n  \"action\": {\n    \"type\": \"tool_call\",\n    \"tool_request\": {\n      \"tool_name\": \"get_database_schema\",\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    }\n  },\n  \"conversation_update\": {\n    \"content\": \"I am checking the current database schema to determine whether new tables are required before creating the agent.\"\n  },\n  \"reasoning\": {\n    \"summary\": \"Schema must be verified before generating or requesting table creation.\"\n  },\n  \"ui_feedback\": {\n    \"status\": \"working\",\n    \"message\": \"Inspecting database schema...\"\n  }\n}\n```\n\n"
